<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-nanshi" book-id="b-nanshi-024" chapter-id="c-nanshi-024-wangqing" source-id="s-nanshi-024-wangqing-ws1765279">
  <p id="c-nanshi-024-wangqing:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanshi-024-wangqing:p001:m0000" ref="72e_1a7_3ac_AA">進之</persName>子<persName id="c-nanshi-024-wangqing:p001:m0003" ref="72e_1a7_3ac_AAA">清</persName>，位散騎常侍，金紫光祿大夫，鎭東府長史，新野、東陽二郡太守，安南將軍，封中廬公。承聖末，陳武帝殺太尉<persName id="c-nanshi-024-wangqing:p001:m0054" ref="g7w_9tv_iqb">王僧辯</persName>，遣文帝攻<persName id="c-nanshi-024-wangqing:p001:m0062" ref="g7w_9tv_iqb">僧辯</persName>婿<persName id="c-nanshi-024-wangqing:p001:m0065" ref="sqi_qy6_6bu_ABA">杜龕</persName>，<persName id="c-nanshi-024-wangqing:p001:m0068" ref="sqi_qy6_6bu_ABA">龕</persName>告難於<persName id="c-nanshi-024-wangqing:p001:m0072" ref="72e_1a7_3ac_AAA">清</persName>，引兵援<persName id="c-nanshi-024-wangqing:p001:m0077" ref="sqi_qy6_6bu_ABA">龕</persName>，大敗陳文帝于呉興，追奔至晉陵。時廣州刺史<persName id="c-nanshi-024-wangqing:p001:m0099" ref="qil_wym_gc2_AA">歐陽頠</persName>亦同<persName id="c-nanshi-024-wangqing:p001:m0104" ref="72e_1a7_3ac_AAA">清</persName>援<persName id="c-nanshi-024-wangqing:p001:m0106" ref="sqi_qy6_6bu_ABA">龕</persName>，中更改異，殺<persName id="c-nanshi-024-wangqing:p001:m0114" ref="72e_1a7_3ac_AAA">清</persName>而歸陳武帝。子<persName id="c-nanshi-024-wangqing:p001:m0122" ref="72e_1a7_3ac_AAAA">猛</persName>。</p>
</text>
